{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: `y_aux`, `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. Both protected observations are top-level data variables and are each observed exactly once with plain built-in sampling statements. All parameters have exactly one built-in prior before use.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;  // Number of observations
  array[N] real y;       // Observations

  int<lower=1> N_aux;  // Number of auxiliary observations
  array[N_aux] real y_aux;   // Auxiliary observations
}

parameters {
  real a;
  real b;
  real<lower=0> sigma;
  real<lower=0> sigma_aux;
}

model {
  // Prior model
  a ~ normal(0, 1);
  b ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma ~ normal(0, 1);
  sigma_aux ~ normal(0, 1);

  // Auxiliary observational model
  y_aux ~ normal(a, sigma_aux);

  // Observational model
  y ~ normal(a + b, sigma);
}

","data_safe_json":"{"N":3,"N_aux":1,"y":[3.0,3.0,3.0],"y_aux":[1.0]}","protected_variables":["y_aux","y"]}
